        ("What is the mode of the dataset: 2, 3, 3, 4, 5, 3, 6?", "3", ["4", "2", "5"], "The number 3 appears most frequently (3 times)."),
        ("What is the range of the dataset: 4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42?", "38", ["42", "4", "35"], "Range = Maximum - Minimum = 42 - 4 = 38."),
