        ("If a coin is tossed 3 times, what is the total number of outcomes in the sample space?", "8", ["6", "9", "4"], "2^3 = 8 possible outcomes (HHH, HHT, HTH, HTT, THH, THT, TTH, TTT)."),
        ("What is qualitative data?", "Descriptive, non-numerical data (e.g., hair color, satisfaction rating)", ["Numerical measurements", "Continuous numbers", "Integer counts"], "Qualitative (categorical) data represents non-numeric qualities or labels."),
