        ("A variable that can take only discrete integer values (e.g., number of children) is:", "Discrete variable", ["Continuous variable", "Qualitative variable", "Random seed"], "Discrete variables have countable values with no intermediate values possible."),
        ("What is the median of an even number of sorted observations?", "Average of the two middle values", ["The highest middle value", "The lowest middle value", "The mode"], "For an even sample size n, median = (Value at n/2 + Value at n/2+1) / 2."),
