        ("In a perfectly symmetrical normal distribution, what is the relationship between Mean, Median, and Mode?", "Mean = Median = Mode", ["Mean > Median > Mode", "Mode > Median > Mean", "They are unrelated"], "Symmetry causes the center of mass, median, and peak mode to coincide exactly."),
        ("What is a census?", "A study that collects data from every individual in the entire population", ["A small survey", "A machine learning algorithm", "A statistical chart"], "A census surveys the complete target population rather than a sample."),
