        ("What is the mean (expected value) of a Binomial distribution with parameters n and p?", "n * p", ["n * p * (1 - p)", "sqrt(n * p)", "p / n"], "The expected value of Binomial B(n, p) is E(X) = n * p."),
        ("What is the variance of a Binomial distribution with parameters n and p?", "n * p * (1 - p)", ["n * p", "sqrt(n * p)", "(n * p)^2"], "Var(X) = n * p * q where q = 1 - p."),
