        ("Which CSS property changes the text color of an element?", "color", ["text-color", "font-color", "fill"], "The 'color' property in CSS specifies foreground text color."),
        ("Which CSS property controls the size of text fonts?", "font-size", ["text-size", "font-style", "size"], "'font-size' sets the glyph size using units like px, rem, em, or %."),
        ("What character is used in CSS to select elements by their HTML 'class' attribute?", ". (Dot / Period)", ["# (Hash)", "* (Asterisk)", "@ (At symbol)"], "A dot prefix (.classname) targets elements belonging to that class."),
