        ("What CSS property truncates overflowing single-line text with an ellipsis (...)?", "text-overflow: ellipsis", ["overflow-wrap: cut", "word-break: break-all", "white-space: clip"], "Combined with 'overflow: hidden' and 'white-space: nowrap', 'text-overflow: ellipsis' truncates with ..."),
        ("What is the purpose of CSS Reset or Normalize.css stylesheets?", "Eliminate cross-browser default styling inconsistencies and margins", ["Reset database tables", "Clear browser cache", "Compress CSS files"], "Reset/normalize stylesheets establish consistent baseline styles across different web browsers."),
        ("Which CSS property controls transparency of an element?", "opacity", ["transparency", "alpha", "visibility"], "'opacity' ranges from 0.0 (completely transparent) to 1.0 (fully opaque).")
