        ("What does 'Air-Gapping' mean in physical and network security?", "Physically isolating a secure computer network from the internet and outside networks", ["Installing air conditioning in server rooms", "Using WiFi instead of cables", "Blowing air into fans"], "Air-gapped systems have zero physical or wireless network interfaces connecting to external environments."),
