        ("What is Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR)?", "Tool monitoring endpoint devices to detect, investigate, and remediate advanced threats in real time", ["An email spam filter", "A network router switch", "A data backup tape"], "EDR agents continuously monitor host activities, providing telemetry and automated isolation capabilities."),
